<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 2</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Democratize computing education across the university, connecting the technical "Hub" with multidisciplinary "Spokes" to increase enrollment and interdisciplinary competence.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td>
<table class="media-large">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable">News - Image - Large <br />One Column, Image Width: 1000px, Height: 405 px* <br />Two Column, Image Width: 735px, Height: 405 px* <br />* Recommended Height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="image"><img src="/images/news/placeholder/news-large-image.jpg" alt="" /></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4>Strategies</h4>
<table class="two-column-text">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 1</th>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 2</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Interdisciplinary majors: Launch new "+ X" joint majors to attract students from outside traditional engineering fields.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Enable joint appointments: Create "MOU templates for joint hires" with cross-college grant credit at 25%, 49%, 51%, and 75% appointment in Bellini College. &nbsp;</li>
<li>Recruitment outreach: Improve visibility by engaging high schools, community colleges, four-year colleges and industry partners.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Flat governance: Maintain a flat administrative structure to minimize bureaucracy and facilitate faster curriculum approval and affiliate faculty appointments.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Instructional capacity: Hire additional instructional faculty to support the expansion of certificates and badges.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4>Success Indicators&nbsp;</h4>
<ul>
<li>Interdisciplinary degrees awarded: Number of degrees awarded in "+ X" joint majors to measure the effectiveness of the "Spoke" integration.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Cross-college research awards: Dollar value of research grants and contracts involving faculty from Bellini College co-investigating with faculty from other USF colleges and units.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Affiliate faculty engagement: Number of non-Bellini faculty holding affiliate or joint appointments with the college to measure the effectiveness of true collaboration.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Non-computing student upskilling: Number of non-computer science majors completing courses, minors, certificates, or "boot camps.&rdquo;&nbsp;</li>
</ul><!-- /com.omniupdate.div -->
</maincontent>

